<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Summon Jetpack in Helldiver 2. Please note keybind for strategem input must be set to the arrow keys on your keyboard</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
